{"unit_id":"dan-cube__dsh-logo-ui#card-zh","repo":"dan-cube/dsh-logo-ui","commit":"a46d0c0d1d4052bbda0f650d0e177ab750c650c5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Logo UI 是面向 DSH Web 界面的外观定制插件，在侧栏品牌、会话首屏和设置页插入客户端组件。它支持上传并本地处理自定义 Logo、调整颜色尺寸和对齐、控制首屏标志与底部水印、设置正文及侧栏字号，并提供中英文设置、配置导入导出和快捷键。适合希望调整 DSH 品牌视觉与阅读字号的用户。图片与设置保存在浏览器本地，无需 API 密钥或额外服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:730-778","client.js:1004-1022"]}
{"unit_id":"dan-cube__dsh-logo-ui#card-en","repo":"dan-cube/dsh-logo-ui","commit":"a46d0c0d1d4052bbda0f650d0e177ab750c650c5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Logo UI customizes DSH Web branding. Upload and locally process a logo, adjust its colors and size, control where it appears, and change typography. Bilingual settings support import, export, and shortcuts. Logo data stays in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:730-778","client.js:1004-1022"]}
